{{!-- hero-variant — the post header's art direction, tag → class.

     Emits ONLY the modifier. A partial because the answer is needed by the
     header element and by the cover slot, and a chain copied twice drifts the
     first time a sixth variant is added.

     #hero-1…5 map onto NSDS's own .ns-posthead modifiers, so five header
     treatments cost this theme no CSS. Unrecognised or absent → the default,
     so a post that predates the tag renders correctly rather than unstyled. --}}
{{~#has tag="#hero-2"~}} ns-posthead--center
{{~else has tag="#hero-3"~}} ns-posthead--wide
{{~else has tag="#hero-4"~}} ns-posthead--split
{{~else has tag="#hero-5"~}} ns-posthead--bleed
{{~/has~}}
